tch-Ultra-2-Complications-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Complications\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16479,\"date\":\"2026-07-24T11:40:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-24T09:40:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"emergency-sos-via-satellite-arriva-anche-in-andorra-e-islanda\",\"title\":\"Emergency SOS via satellite arriva anche in Andorra e Islanda\",\"excerpt\":\"Emergency SOS via satellite si espande in Andorra e Islanda: disponibile su iPhone 14 e successivi e Apple Watch Ultra 3 con iOS 26.4 e watchOS 26.4 o versioni successive.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Emergency-SOS-via-Satellite-iPhone-YT-768x430.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Emergency-SOS-via-Satellite-iPhone-YT\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16475,\"date\":\"2026-07-24T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-24T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-patenti-id-apple-wallet-utah\",\"title\":\"iPhone: le patenti e le ID potrebbero arrivare anche in Utah su Apple Wallet\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi segnali indicano che Apple potrebbe estendere il supporto di patenti e documenti in Apple Wallet anche agli utenti iPhone e Apple Watch in Utah.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/apple-wallet-drivers-license-feature-iPhone-15-pro-purple-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-wallet-drivers-license-feature-iPhone-15-pro-purple-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16473,\"date\":\"2026-07-24T08:11:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-24T06:11:21+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-10-miglioramenti-perfo